                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <p>The prosperity spoken of in this message is not the fruit of the King’s policy
                    and legislation, but of American enterprise and energy, notwithstanding the
                    hundred-and-one obstacles which his Majesty and his ministers throw in the way
                    to hinder it.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. Mc. B.</signed></closer>
            </div>
